  <item>
    <title>女性友谊 这世界还是缺乏想象力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69281f27cf0deb51a00c10d7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69281f27cf0deb51a00c10d7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Nov 2025 09:55:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;读亦舒名作《流金岁月》，看如黄金般珍贵的女性友谊。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;两个人对真诚、边界、尊重等价值观和双方底线的认知构成了友谊的基础。精神上的互相欣赏和相互守望建立了友谊的护城河。友谊不是两个人的复制粘贴，而是在差异处保持边界，在共同点深化友情。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你会听到以下内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="231">00:03:51</a> 流量世界，大家还会追寻真挚的友谊吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">00:12:00</a> 友情三大支柱：不评判。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">00:13:45</a> 回溯锁锁和南孙的友谊，真友谊永不过时。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1027">00:17:07</a> 主体性强的人更能创造一段互相赋能的友谊。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1943">00:32:23</a> “我成功她不嫉妒，我萎靡她不轻视。”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">00:36:00</a> YU的友情“门当户对原理”，心智以及核心价值观。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">00:40:04</a> 对于摆烂的朋友，YU和萱的不同接受度。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2808">00:46:48</a> 《流金岁月》的女性友谊，没有落“雌竞”俗套。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3366">00:56:06</a> 行动派的友谊才最珍贵。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">00:58:52</a> 那些令人落泪的友尽故事。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4692">01:18:12</a> 友情三大支柱：真诚的支撑。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5013">01:23:33</a> 友情三大支柱：对对方品格的欣赏与爱。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5690">01:34:50</a> 在差异处保持边界，在共同点深化友情。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「音乐」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Dark Chariot - 梅林茂</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「联合主播」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>友萱：走上自媒体牌桌开心打牌的牌友。抖音、小红书、视频号全网同名博主。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>YU： 深耕在国际品牌公关界，不按常理出牌的牌友。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「合作以及听友群」</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMgAcMM74Cn1pU-Vx9YGghAyB6Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmJqHN-uXorQDJSOrGrCAV0fhMR_.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
