  <item>
    <title>年底向上社交高峰期！听YU&amp;友萱讲述饭局鬼故事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/690b4ba4b0bdc24d1d377de9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">690b4ba4b0bdc24d1d377de9</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Nov 2025 13:14:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>「关于向上社交」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;无论遇到谁，在内心深处，永远不需要仰望和渴求。我们在人格上都是平等的。每个人都有自己的天命，专注于自己的事，去完成自己的天命，对别人无所求。一个人一旦有这股子劲，是非常有人格魅力的。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;对别人的仰仗和依赖，那种失去主体性的攀附和浓厚的崇拜是得不到尊重的。你不但不会得到预想的拯救，还会失去最最可贵的～自己拯救自己的勇气。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「本期你将会听到」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:00:40</a> YU和友萱开始了忙忙碌碌的年底向上社交高峰期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="153">00:02:33</a> 向上社交难吗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="383">00:06:23</a> 社交的核心</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a> 社交最最紧要三大要素</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">00:10:35</a> 社交中的价值交换，我们到底在交换什么</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">00:13:13</a> 社交中强大主体性的力量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">00:13:50</a> 不耗损生命盲目混圈子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">00:18:28</a> YU的饭局鬼故事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1813">00:30:13</a> 友萱的饭局鬼故事</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">00:40:50</a> 如何优雅应对年底商务饭局</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3165">00:52:45</a> 如何识别一个值得深交的真君子</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">01:05:50</a> 真诚靠谱在虚伪的花花世界中含金量持续上升</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「参考书目」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《人类简史：从动物到上帝》以色列历史学家 尤瓦尔·赫拉利</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《弱链接的力量》美国社会学家 马克·格兰诺维特</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《社会生活中的交换与权利》奥地利社会学家 彼得布劳</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「带感配乐」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《Ladies Room》- Olivia Dean 来自专辑《Messy》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「联合主播」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>友萱：走上自媒体牌桌开心打牌的牌友。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;抖音、小红书、视频号全网同名博主。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>YU： 深耕在国际品牌公关界，从不按常理出牌的牌友。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「听友群」</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsL_jBGacPgo5RlnaImb1_g-Dl9I.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhj-2zGffV5N1fUdi09BBUAGmblq.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
