    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f771b0456ffec65ed837e8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Oct 2025 11:57:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>这是两位身材健美、体重不轻、鄙视白瘦幼审美姐姐的心声！</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>我们追求的是年轻态，不是幼态。爱惜自己的身体，爱自己的年龄，爱自己的来时路。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>跟小时候的我们和长大的我们一起聊聊身材管理这个又痛又爱的话题吧～</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>「我们将谈到」</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00:00</a> 25年维密大秀引出对女性身材审美多样化的议题</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">00:02:50</a> YU三探悉尼邦德海滩所见所闻，享受美好身体带来的“刺激”</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">00:08:10</a> 被姥姥揣胖的YU</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">00:14:03</a> YU走向拉拉队大舞台</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="988">00:16:28</a> 被妈妈的西藏牛骨髓茶揣胖的萱</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1250">00:20:50</a> 萱第一次在雌竞中落败的感悟</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">00:25:30</a> YU减肥第一天就被拉去打点滴惹～</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2135">00:35:35</a> 模特里最胖的人见证模特们超不健 康减重方式</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">00:37:45</a> 身材焦虑最可怕的地方</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2407">00:40:07</a> 一个人的样貌和他的人生有什么样的联系</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2675">00:44:35</a> 东亚的白瘦幼文化</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">00:47:09</a> 李敖择偶五个字：瘦高白秀幼</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">00:48:30</a> 请放弃给大脑裹小脚</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3198">00:53:18</a> &nbsp;终于理解李湘和晓庆姐为啥被盛赞</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">00:55:20</a> 两个40脚女生的泪与乐</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3650">01:00:50</a> 我们谈减肥到底减的是什么</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">01:02:22</a> 我们减肥的感悟和经验，YU哽咽了～</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4502">01:15:02</a> &nbsp;赶走身材焦虑，拥抱美好明天。</span></strong></p><p></p><p><strong><span>「music」</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>So Easy — 《the Art of Loving》Olivia Dean</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrPqj5ow4d5fNZ-aiA4Fd0lpdqAL.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2k_CqnSA7EGZlo8El9ZH4c_8Fm.JPG"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg6XZP-fbogxvQpKdpnc9byKZu23.JPG"></figure><p><strong><span>「联合主播」</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>友萱：走上自媒体牌桌开心打牌的牌友。抖音、小红书、视频号全网同名博主。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>YU： 深耕在国际品牌公关界，花式出牌的牌友。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>「听友群可加」</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsL_jBGacPgo5RlnaImb1_g-Dl9I.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
